        <mxCell id="BfaGi0TInTkCwpDHoWxU-214" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Описание взаимодействий&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="227" y="1399" width="310" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="BfaGi0TInTkCwpDHoWxU-215" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;1 Создание/редактирование/пользователя. Пользователь регестрируется в системе и заполняет информацию о себе&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;2 Получение JWT токена для авторизации и аутентификации&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;3. Получение информации о пользователе, правах, ролевой модели&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;4. Возвращение JWT токена&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;5. Пользователь получает список товаров&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;6. Пользователь создает заказ&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;7. Отправка события о создании/изменении/статуса заказа. Добавлении товара и т.п.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;8. Пользователь добавляет товары в заказ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;9.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-weight: 400; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Формирование оплаты.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Пользователь выбирает способ оплаты и формирует заявку на оплату&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;10.&amp;nbsp; Публикация события на формирование оплаты.Отправка события на создание счета и формирование платежного документа&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;11. Получено событие на создание оплаты. Сформирован платежный документ и объект оплаты&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;12. Оплата счета. Пользователь получает информацию о счете и оплачивает его&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;13. Публикация события на оплату в соответствующий для платежной системы топик.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;14. Обработка события на оплату&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;15. Выполнение транзакции. Сервис медиатор выполняет операцию оплаты и формирует ответ.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;16. Предоставление результата оплаты. Сервис медиатор формирует ответное событие по результату оплаты&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;17. Получение результата оплаты и закрытие счета.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;18. Формирование события со статусом оплаты&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;19. Обновление статуса заказа по результатам оплаты&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;20. Создание редактирование услуги. Пользователь создает/редактирует услугу&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;6-20. Пользователь формирует заказ на оплату услуг&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;21. Создание/редактирование и управление аукционами. Пользователь формирует аукцион, проводит аукцион.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;22. Победитель аукциона выполняет оплату&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;23. Подтверждение выполнения оплаты&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;24. Пользователь формирует заявку на поддержку (тех.обращение, апелляция и др)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;25. Специалист поддержки выполняет работы по заявке&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;26. В случае необходимости формирует апелляцию через сервис управления заявками&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;27. В ходе разбора заявки принимается решение о откате транзакции&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;29. Выполнение возврата средств&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;30. Выполнение отката в сервисе заказов и аукционов на основании события отката&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;---&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;31. Администратор выполняет редактирование заказа&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;32. Администратор формирует отчет на основании&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
